Right now, I’m developing this engine as a hobby project. 
I know it won’t be as massive or professional as Chromium or Ladybird. 
I’d like to know—from those cloning the repository or reading this—what 
you dislike about it and what features you’d like to see. 
If you’d like to help the project yourself and address a specific issue, 
I’d be happy to accept issues and pull requests!

if you want to test it:
    - 1. git clone https://github.com/erqeon/twink
    - 2. cd twink
    - 3. cargo run